{
  "bodyHash": "/0zZ+HgWZUI=",
  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Friends&amp;Foes\" width=\"836\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Buy Me a Coffee&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Buy Me a Coffee\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Become a Patron&amp;color=5b9c51&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon\" alt=\"Patreon\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/924964658169913404?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;label=Join Our Discord&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Join Our Discord\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Wiki&amp;logoColor=ffffff&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=5b9c51&amp;color=5b9c51\" alt=\"Wiki\"> </a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 加入了在生物投票中落選或被遺忘的生物。主要目標之一是進一步擴展原始概念，並為所有生物添加新的、符合原版風格的特色功能。</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">你可以查閱 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">wiki</a> 以獲取已實作生物與功能的詳細概覽。</p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:33px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab.gif\" alt=\"Crab\" width=\"60\">&nbsp;&nbsp;螃蟹</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab\" rel=\"nofollow\">螃蟹</a>，一種在紅樹林沼澤與海灘漫遊的友善生物。想延長你的觸及範圍嗎？蟹鉗可用來釀造能增加觸及距離的藥水，為你的冒險帶來寶貴優勢。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Crab#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 這小傢伙，你需要海帶與耐心，因為螃蟹需要將卵「埋藏」在安全的地方。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_1.webp\" alt=\"揮手的螃蟹\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcrab_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/crab_2.webp\" alt=\"螃蟹爬上紅樹林樹木\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與螃蟹相關的其他功能：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Craw-Claw\" rel=\"nofollow\">蟹鉗</a> 物品</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Reaching\" rel=\"nofollow\">延伸觸及</a> 狀態效果</li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;line-height:41px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem.gif\" alt=\"Tuff Golem\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;凝灰岩傀儡</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">凝灰岩傀儡</a>，一種雕像般的生物，能持有並展示你給它的任何物品，但要小心，當它不沉睡時，它喜歡隨意漫步。想讓你的凝灰岩傀儡待在原地嗎？用 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#glueing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a> 把它黏住。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 這沉睡的美人，收集一個凝灰岩方塊、一個任意 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Tuff-Golem#dyeing\" rel=\"nofollow\">顏色</a> 的羊毛方塊，以及一個南瓜。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"凝灰岩傀儡持有附魔書\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ftuff_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/tuff_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"沉睡的凝灰岩傀儡\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal.gif\" alt=\"Rascal\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;搗蛋鬼</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">發現 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Rascal\" rel=\"nofollow\">搗蛋鬼</a>，一個位於礦坑中、調皮的小生物，它從捉迷藏遊戲中獲得樂趣。它既好玩又樂於助人，在你尋找它時會給予提示。找到它三次，它將獎勵你夢寐以求的束口袋！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_1.webp\" alt=\"礦坑中的搗蛋鬼\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252frascal_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/rascal_2.webp\" alt=\"搗蛋鬼丟出束口袋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem.gif\" alt=\"Copper Golem\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;銅傀儡</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">認識 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡</a>，一個口袋大小、充滿喜感的奇蹟，它從隨機按下銅製按鈕中獲得樂趣。與其他銅製造物一樣，它會隨著時間 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#oxidation\" rel=\"nofollow\">氧化</a>，但別擔心，維護輕而易舉！要快速翻新，拿一把 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#scraping\" rel=\"nofollow\">斧頭</a> 或一個 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#waxing\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂巢</a>。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem#creation\" rel=\"nofollow\">建造</a> 這小生物，收集一個銅方塊、一個南瓜和一個避雷針。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_1.webp\" alt=\"村莊中的銅傀儡工作站結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fcopper_golem_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/copper_golem_2.webp\" alt=\"銅傀儡們\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與銅傀儡相關的其他功能：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Golem-Workstation\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅傀儡工作站</a> 村莊結構</li>\n<li>所有銅製變種的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Copper-Button\" rel=\"nofollow\">銅按鈕</a></li>\n<li>所有銅製變種的 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Lightning-Rod\" rel=\"nofollow\">避雷針</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare.webp\" alt=\"Glare\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;怒目怪</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare\" rel=\"nofollow\">怒目怪</a>，住在繁茂洞穴中、脾氣暴躁又可愛的苔蘚夥伴，它厭惡黑暗。你也厭惡黑暗嗎？那樣的話，怒目怪可以向你顯示足夠黑暗、會生成怪物的區域。如果你想 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#taming\" rel=\"nofollow\">馴服</a> 或 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Glare#breeding\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁殖</a> 這小可愛，你需要發光莓果，但要小心，怒目怪傾向於定期啃食它們，不留任何剩餘。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_1.webp\" alt=\"幼年與成年怒目怪\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fglare_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/glare_2.webp\" alt=\"繁茂洞穴中飛行的怒目怪\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer.webp\" alt=\"Iceologer\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;冰術師</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰術師</a>，一位獨居在雪地深處的孤獨災厄村民。你可以在樹林中尋找一個小型雲杉 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">小屋</a> 來找到他。但在冒險中要小心，因為多年的野外生活使他的心比周圍的冰更冷。如果他發現你，準備迎接 <a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Iceologer-Cabin\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰霜攻擊</a>，將你的冒險變成冰冷的挑戰。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_1.webp\" alt=\"雪地中的冰術師小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252ficeologer_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/iceologer_2.webp\" alt=\"冰術師攻擊村民\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與冰術師相關的其他功能：</<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_1.webp\" alt=\"毛茛花哞菇\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmoobloom_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/moobloom_2.webp\" alt=\"繁花哞菇\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與哞菇相關的其他特色：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Buttercup\" rel=\"nofollow\">毛茛花</a></li>\n<li>所有木材種類的<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beehives\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜂箱</a></li>\n<li>村莊結構<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper-Area\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人區域</a></li>\n<li>村民職業<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Beekeeper\" rel=\"nofollow\">養蜂人</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire.webp\" alt=\"野火\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;野火</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火</a>，烈焰人的主宰，受到四面盾牌的保護。這場遭遇並不友善，小心它的盾牌碎片彈幕和震撼大地的衝擊波攻擊。當被逼入絕境時，它會召喚烈焰人增援。征服挑戰，在其<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">要塞</a>領域中運用策略對抗這名熾熱的守衛。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_1.webp\" alt=\"地獄中的要塞結構\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fwildfire_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/wildfire_2.webp\" alt=\"要塞中的野火\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與野火相關的其他特色：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Citadel\" rel=\"nofollow\">要塞</a>結構</li>\n<li>物品<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火王冠</a></li>\n<li>物品<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Wildfire-Crown-Fragment\" rel=\"nofollow\">野火王冠碎片</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler.webp\" alt=\"猛襲者\" width=\"40\">&nbsp;&nbsp;猛襲者（大飢餓）</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">介紹<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)\" rel=\"nofollow\">猛襲者</a>，這是一種在草原、惡地和沙漠中遊蕩的小型掠食者。它們追尋雞、兔子等獵物。你可以餵食它們附魔物品來<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Mauler-(The-Great-Hunger)#storing-and-extracting-experience-points\" rel=\"nofollow\">儲存經驗值</a>，之後再用玻璃瓶提取。但要小心，經驗值越多，猛襲者就會變得越大、越飢餓！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_1.webp\" alt=\"猛襲者獵捕雞隻\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fmauler_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/mauler_2.webp\" alt=\"被餵食的猛襲者\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner.webp\" alt=\"幻術師\" width=\"25\">&nbsp;&nbsp;幻術師</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">遭遇<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師</a>，這是一名居住在針葉林的狡猾騙徒，手持弓箭。你可以透過尋找小木屋或他的訓練場來找到他。請謹慎接近，因為<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#casting-blindness\" rel=\"nofollow\">致盲法術</a>可能會讓你陷入黑暗，難以區分<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner#summoning-illusions\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象</a>與現實。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_1.webp\" alt=\"針葉林中的幻術師小屋\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fillusioner_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/illusioner_2.webp\" alt=\"訓練場中的幻術師\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">與幻術師相關的其他特色：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li>結構<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Illusioner-Shack\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻術師小屋</a></li>\n<li>物品<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Totem-of-Illusion\" rel=\"nofollow\">幻象圖騰</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse.webp\" alt=\"殭屍馬（陷阱）\" width=\"50\">&nbsp;&nbsp;殭屍馬（陷阱）</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">曾經想騎<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/wiki/Zombie-Horse-(Trap)\" rel=\"nofollow\">殭屍馬</a>嗎？如果是的話，在雷暴期間接近一匹，魔法可能會發生——你甚至可能瞥見四騎士的身影。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_1.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_1.webp\" alt=\"雷暴中的殭屍馬\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a> <a style=\"text-decoration:none\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252f.github%252fassets%252fmedia%252fimages%252fzombie_horse_2.webp\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/master/.github/assets/media/images/zombie_horse_2.webp\" alt=\"雷暴中的四騎士\" width=\"49.4%\"> </a></p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">⚙️ 相容性 / 附加元件</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">Friends&amp;Foes 設計為與所有其他模組完全相容，目前提供一些附加元件和資料包：</p><ul style=\"font-size:18px\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-flowery-mooblooms-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 繁花哞菇</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/friends-and-foes-beekeeper-hut-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Friends&amp;Foes - 養蜂人小屋</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/repurposed-structures-friends-and-foes-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Repurposed Structures - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ctov-friends-and-foes-compat\" rel=\"nofollow\">CTOV - Friends and Foes 相容資料包</a></li>\n</ul><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">💬 社群</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎<a href=\"https://discord.gg/QGwFvvMQCn\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我們的 Discord 伺服器社群</a>，聊天、分享你的創作、提出任何問題，或單純獲取模組最新開發動態，並在新版本發布時收到通知。也請不要猶豫<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">透過 GitHub Issues 回報任何崩潰或錯誤</a>。</p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">👋 支持</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">我將繼續以興趣開發我的模組，因為我真心享受這個過程。如果你想支持我，可以在<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Faboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>或<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffaboslav\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ko-fi</a>上進行。非常感謝你的支持。</p><p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:28px;color:#e5e5e5\">📜 授權</span></p><hr><p style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組採用<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fFaboslav%252ffriends-and-foes%252fmaster%252fLICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC BY-NC-ND 4.0</a>授權。</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">歡迎探索我的程式碼，作為我開發此模組時解決各種挑戰的範例。你可以將程式碼片段用於自己的專案中。也歡迎在任何模組包中使用此模組（雖然若能註明出處或連結回此頁面，將不勝感激）。</p><p style=\"font-size:18px\">你也可以查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/blockbench\" rel=\"nofollow\">Blockbench 目錄</a>，其中包含所有模型與調色盤，以及<a href=\"https://github.com/Faboslav/friends-and-foes/tree/master/common/src/main/resources/assets/friendsandfoes/textures\" rel=\"nofollow\">紋理目錄</a>中的紋理。從中獲取靈感，但請不要直接複製貼上作為己用。</p>",
